.SH ENVIRONMENTAL VARIABLES
.TP
.B LANG
This is the system language on Unix-like operating systems.

.SH FILES
.TP
.B *.bin:
General binary file for load/save memory content.
.TP
.B *.clprj:
Project file. Contains the static description of the simulation environment,
including the configuration, positions, and sizes of the visual modules.
.TP
.B *.clsce:
CoreLAB scriptembly file. Executable script that dynamically builds the
simulation environment at runtime by instantiating modules. It controls the
simulation, manages debug windows, evaluates data and handles data loading/saving.
.TP
.B yymmddhhmmss.clsht:
CoreLAB snapshot. The instantaneous and restorable state of the framework and
the simulation.
.TP
.B corelab.ini:
General settings. Stores general application preferences, including interface
colors, dimensions, and saved window positions.
.TP
.B *.hex:
Intel hexa file for load/save memory content.
.TP
.B *.log:
General log file (loggers output file).

